    <History>
        <Update release="3">
            <Date>2026-08-02</Date>
            <Version>1.3.6</Version>
            <Comment>Version bump to 1.3.6 (Meson build). Keep get_categories/get_packages patch (0002) for KDE Discover; drop unused 0001 PiSi-support patch. 0002 also drops the orphan pk_backend_update_system (role removed in 1.3.6, breaks -Werror=missing-prototypes). Ship the Python 2 packagekit helper module (packagekit-py2) because the pisi backend still runs under Python 2 (pisi itself is Python 2 only on this distro) while 1.3.6 installs its own helper only for Python 3.</Comment>
